    title: "知名以太坊 MEV 機器人 JaredFromSubway 遭詐騙攻擊，損失 1,500 萬美元加密貨幣",
    summary: "以太坊知名夾心攻擊機器人 JaredFromSubway 近期遭駭客鎖定，損失總計 1,500 萬美元的 WETH、USDC 與 USDT。攻擊者透過部署偽造的獲利交易機會，誘騙該自動化系統執行交易並授予 ERC-20 代幣許可（Approval）。攻擊者先以小額測試確認機器人邏輯，隨後利用未撤銷的授權，透過 transferFrom 函數進行非法提款。此事件突顯了 MEV 自動化執行邏輯的資安風險。目前營運商正嘗試與駭客協商並提供懸賞金以求歸還資金，但尚未達成協議。建議相關自動化系統應加強對執行路由的驗證與授權管理，並定期審計合約權限，避免敏感合約被濫用。",
    tags: ["JaredFromSubway", "MEV", "以太坊", "加密貨幣竊案", "區塊鏈安全", "夾心攻擊", "Blockaid"],
    title_en: "Prominent Ethereum MEV Bot JaredFromSubway Targeted in Scam, Loses $15 Million in Cryptocurrency",
    summary_en: "The well-known Ethereum sandwich bot JaredFromSubway was recently targeted by hackers, resulting in a total loss of $15 million in WETH, USDC, and USDT. The attacker deployed fake profitable trading opportunities to trick the automated system into executing trades and granting ERC-20 token approvals. After testing the bot's logic with small amounts, the attacker leveraged the unrevoked permissions to conduct unauthorized withdrawals via the transferFrom function. This incident highlights the security risks inherent in MEV automated execution logic. The operators are currently attempting to negotiate with the hacker and have offered a bounty for the return of funds, but no agreement has been reached yet. It is recommended that operators of similar automated systems strengthen validation and authorization management for execution routes and perform regular audits of contract permissions to prevent the abuse of sensitive contracts.",
    tags_en: ["JaredFromSubway", "MEV", "Ethereum", "Cryptocurrency Theft", "Blockchain Security", "Sandwich Attack", "Blockaid"],
    sources: [
      { name: "BleepingComputer", url: "https://bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/jaredfromsubway-mev-bot-hacked-in-15-million-crypto-theft", lang: "EN" }
    ]
