    title: "AirPods Max 2 韌體 Beta 更新現已開放，支援 iOS 27 與 macOS 27 Beta 2",
    summary: "蘋果已開放 AirPods Max 2 的韌體 Beta 更新，使用者現在可以在運行 iOS 27 或 macOS 27 Golden Gate Beta 2 的設備上，透過耳機設定中的「AirPods Beta Updates」開關進行註冊。此功能允許使用者在耳機放置於充電盒並靠近配對的 iPhone 或 Mac 時，自動安裝韌體更新。除了 AirPods Max 2，其他型號如 AirPods 4、AirPods Pro 3、AirPods Pro 2 (USB-C) 和 AirPods Pro 2 (Lightning) 也可透過此 Beta 程式更新韌體。這對於早期測試者和開發者群組來說，提供了了解新系統與硬體整合的機會。修補建議是，若為早期測試者，應遵循蘋果官方指引，在指定系統版本上啟用 Beta 更新。",
    tags: ["AirPods Max 2", "iOS 27", "macOS 27", "韌體更新", "Beta 測試", "Apple"],
    title_en: "AirPods Max 2 Firmware Beta Update Now Available, Supporting iOS 27 and macOS 27 Beta 2",
    summary_en: "Apple has released a firmware Beta update for the AirPods Max 2. Users can now enroll for this update via the 'AirPods Beta Updates' toggle in the headphone settings on devices running iOS 27 or macOS 27 Golden Gate Beta 2. This feature allows the firmware update to be automatically installed when the AirPods are placed in the charging case and near a paired iPhone or Mac. In addition to the AirPods Max 2, other models such as AirPods 4, AirPods Pro 3, AirPods Pro 2 (USB-C), and AirPods Pro 2 (Lightning) can also receive firmware updates through this Beta program. This provides early testers and developers with an opportunity to understand the integration of new systems and hardware. The recommendation is that early testers should follow Apple's official guidelines and enable the Beta update on the specified system versions.",
