    category: "Apple",
    title: "Apple 發布 macOS 27 Golden Gate Beta 2，強化 Liquid Glass 與全新 Siri AI 功能",
    summary: "Apple 已發布 macOS 27 Golden Gate 的第二個開發者測試版（Beta 2），該版本為 26A5368g。本次更新主要著重於使用者介面（UI）的優化與功能升級。macOS 27 Golden Gate 提升了 Liquid Glass 的透明度調整功能，並統一了系統窗口、應用程式和程序的圓角設計，解決了前一個版本（macOS 26）的常見抱怨。此外，新版本引入了全新的 Siri AI，該 AI 搭配的應用程式利用底層的新索引系統，能更精準地整合相關資訊，作為生成答案的基礎。整體系統的運作，都依賴於第三代 Apple Foundation Models。開發者可透過「系統設定」中的「軟體更新」進行安裝。本版本為開發者測試版，建議使用者在測試前備份設備。",
    tags: ["Apple", "macOS 27", "Golden Gate", "Siri AI", "Liquid Glass", "Beta 2"],
    title_en: "Apple Releases macOS 27 Golden Gate Beta 2, Enhancing Liquid Glass and Introducing New Siri AI Features",
    summary_en: "Apple has released the second developer beta (Beta 2) for macOS 27 Golden Gate, version 26A5368g. This update primarily focuses on user interface (UI) optimization and feature upgrades. macOS 27 Golden Gate enhances the transparency adjustment function of Liquid Glass and unifies the rounded corner design across system windows, applications, and processes, addressing common complaints from the previous version (macOS 26). Furthermore, the new version introduces a brand-new Siri AI. Applications utilizing this AI leverage a new underlying indexing system to more accurately integrate relevant information, which serves as the basis for generating answers. The overall system operation relies on the third-generation Apple Foundation Models. Developers can install this version through 'Software Update' in 'System Settings'. As this is a developer beta, users are advised to back up their devices before testing.",
