    category: "重點關注",
    title: "Wayland 專案發布 xfwl4 初步版本：Xfce 環境的 Wayland 合成器",
    summary: "Wayland 專案成員 Brian Tarricone 宣布了 xfwl4 的首次預覽版本。xfwl4 是一個專為 Xfce 桌面環境設計的 Wayland 合成器（compositor）。該專案經過近六個月的開發，目標是讓使用者在 Xfce 運行於 X 伺服器和運行於 Wayland 時，能盡可能地無縫切換，達到接近原生體驗的目標。這是一個初步的 Alpha 版本，目前仍存在錯誤和功能缺失。開發者表示，這是一個穩定的初步版本，但仍需持續工作以達到理想的平滑度。此更新主要針對桌面環境的基礎架構升級，而非修補特定漏洞，建議使用者關注 Wayland 相關的桌面環境遷移與測試。",
    tags: ["Wayland", "xfwl4", "Xfce", "Wayland compositor", "桌面環境", "Linux"],
    title_en: "Wayland Project Releases Initial Version of xfwl4: A Wayland Compositor for Xfce",
    summary_en: "Wayland project member Brian Tarricone has announced the first preview version of xfwl4. xfwl4 is a Wayland compositor specifically designed for the Xfce desktop environment. Developed over nearly six months, the project aims to allow users to switch between Xfce running on an X server and running on Wayland as seamlessly as possible, achieving a near-native experience. This is an initial Alpha version, and it still contains bugs and missing features. The developer noted that while it is a stable preliminary release, continuous work is still required to reach the desired level of smoothness. This update focuses on foundational infrastructure upgrades for the desktop environment rather than patching specific vulnerabilities, and users are advised to stay informed about Wayland-related desktop environment migrations and testing.",
