    category: "重點關注",
    title: "AMD發布librocdxg 1.2.1更新，強化ROCm在Windows Subsystem for Linux (WSL) 的運算支援",
    summary: "AMD發布了更新版本的ROCDXG函式庫（librocdxg），旨在進一步提升ROCm運算堆棧在Windows Subsystem for Linux (WSL) 環境下的支援與穩定性。本次更新的主要改進包括隨發布的amdsmi二進制文件，以優化WSL下的系統管理體驗。此外，AMD也提供了專門的WSL AMD64 Ubuntu套件，簡化了在Windows 11 WSL上使用Ubuntu進行AMD GPU運算堆棧的設定流程。技術層面，工程師更新了AMDSMI的Python封裝，改善了WSL的記憶體和VRAM行為，並新增了透過設定檔支援可配置的設備ID，同時增加了對GFX11.5.3圖形的支援。這些改進使ROCm在跨平台開發和運算場景下的應用更加完善。",
    tags: ["AMD", "ROCm", "librocdxg", "WSL", "Windows Subsystem for Linux", "GPU運算"],
    title_en: "AMD Releases librocdxg 1.2.1 Update, Enhancing ROCm Computing Support in Windows Subsystem for Linux (WSL)",
    summary_en: "AMD has released an updated version of the ROCDXG library (librocdxg), aimed at further improving the support and stability of the ROCm computing stack in the Windows Subsystem for Linux (WSL) environment. The key improvements in this release include the bundled amdsmi binary to optimize the system management experience under WSL. Additionally, AMD has provided specialized WSL AMD64 Ubuntu packages to simplify the setup process for using the AMD GPU computing stack on Ubuntu in Windows 11 WSL. On the technical side, engineers have updated the AMDSMI Python wrappers, improved memory and VRAM behavior in WSL, added support for configurable device IDs via configuration files, and included support for GFX11.5.3 graphics. These improvements further refine the application of ROCm in cross-platform development and computing scenarios.",
