    id: "20260622-090",
    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "重點關注",
    title: "Miracle-WM 0.10 發布：增強 Wayland 組合成器功能，支援更多協議與插件繪圖管線",
    summary: "Canonical 工程師 Matthew Kosarek 發布了 Miracle-WM 0.10 版本，這是一個基於 Mir 的 Wayland 組合成器（compositor）。本次更新的主要亮點是大幅提升了插件（plug-in）的能力，允許插件為單個視窗設定專屬的 Shader Pipeline，例如用於焦點模糊（focus blur）功能，同時也能設定輸出 Shader Pipeline，適用於夜間模式（nightlight）等功能。此外，0.10 版本支援多個額外的 Wayland 協議，包括 ext_data_control_manager_v1 等，並引入了 GTK4 客戶端來報告配置錯誤，以及一個用於顯示視窗定位資訊的 GTK4 除錯疊層。這些改進使 Grimshot、wl-copy 和 xdg-desktop-portal-wlr 等相關工具能夠與 Miracle-WM 協同工作。開發團隊目標是在今年晚些時候發布 1.0 版本，預計 1.0 版本將在 2026 年推出。",
    tags: ["Miracle-WM", "Wayland", "Compositor", "Canonical", "GTK4", "Shader Pipeline"],
    title_en: "Miracle-WM 0.10 Released: Enhancing Wayland Compositor Capabilities with Support for Additional Protocols and Plugin Shader Pipelines",
    summary_en: "Canonical engineer Matthew Kosarek has released Miracle-WM 0.10, a Wayland compositor based on Mir. The main highlight of this update is a significant expansion of plugin capabilities, allowing plugins to configure dedicated Shader Pipelines for individual windows, such as for focus blur, as well as output Shader Pipelines for features like nightlight. Additionally, version 0.10 adds support for several extra Wayland protocols, including ext_data_control_manager_v1, and introduces a GTK4 client to report configuration errors, along with a GTK4 debug overlay for displaying window positioning information. These improvements enable related tools such as Grimshot, wl-copy, and xdg-desktop-portal-wlr to interoperate with Miracle-WM. The development team aims to release version 1.0 later this year, with a projected 1.0 release in 2026.",
    tags_en: ["Miracle-WM", "Wayland", "Compositor", "Canonical", "GTK4", "Shader Pipeline"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Phoronix", url: "https://phoronix.com/news/Miracle-WM-0.10", lang: "EN" }
    ]
